[10.429878, "o", "/app\r\n--- MAP ---\r\n"]
[10.430919, "o", "gasket hopper layout\r\n====================\r\n\r\ngaskcli/boot.rs dispatches bind, jab, and cork.\r\n\r\nPipeline modules:\r\n- loomkit/  roster writer\r\n- rimcap/   compiled span\r\n- hopmat/   WIRE replies used by jab\r\n- lidpit/   seal writer\r\n- slipread/ card parse\r\n\r\nCards live in /app/buscards.\r\nbind refreshes /app/mistwell/roster.json and /app/loomkit/emit.lst.\r\njab still answers from the hopper already inside /app/bin/gasketd.\r\nA new roster line from bind does not enroll that WIRE into jab.\r\ncork writes /app/corkbay/seal.json.\r\nIf jab of any card WIRE still prints fallthrough after bind, cork must fail\r\nand status must not be sealed.\r\nFixture copies of the cards sit at /app/cardbak/buscards.\r\n\r\nRebuild the binary with /app/stoke.sh after source edits.\r\n"]
[10.431196, "o", "--- FILES ---\r\n"]
[10.433932, "o", "/app/bin/gasketd\r\n/app/buscards/a_fan.card\r\n/app/buscards/b_pump.card\r\n/app/buscards/c_valve.card\r\n/app/buscards/d_temp.card\r\n/app/buscards/e_press.card\r\n/app/buscards/f_latch.card\r\n/app/buscards/g_bias.card\r\n/app/buscards/h_watch.card\r\n/app/buscards/i_vent.card\r\n/app/cardbak/buscards/a_fan.card\r\n/app/cardbak/buscards/b_pump.card\r\n/app/cardbak/buscards/c_valve.card\r\n/app/cardbak/buscards/d_temp.card\r\n/app/cardbak/buscards/e_press.card\r\n"]
